buildings and put out fires, and most importantly - save humanity from the sinister cult of mind stealers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete 65 levels<br></li><li>Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack<br></li><li>Beautiful desktop wallpapers<br></li><li>Earn dozens of achievements<br></li><li>Lead the investigation and collect a collection of photos<br></li><li>Upgrade equipment, level up heroes<br></li><li>Become a detective and collect your own evidence<br></li><li>Characters\u2019 bios<br></li><li>Game Encyclopedia<br></li><li>Collection of stickers</li></ul>",
